Display all details of a task including description, relationships, labels, and metadata.

Examples:
  paso task show 42
  paso task show -i 42
  paso task show -i 42 -j
  paso task show --id=42 --json

Usage:
  paso task show [id] [flags]

Flags:
  -i, --id int   Task ID (can also be provided as positional argument)
  -j, --json     Output in JSON format
  -q, --quiet    Minimal output (ID only)
